bit.ly/3jwrN96\n\n⬛ … and join the FPL BlackBox league!\nCode: dgetg1\n----------------------------------------------\n🎫 Become a Channel Member and/or become a Godfather Tier member on Patreon!\n\nJoin the community on Patreon!: www.patreon.com/fplblackbox      \n\nWe greatly appreciate all SuperChats as a way of supporting the stream! We will do our best to answer these at the end of the stream\n----------------------------------------------\nFollow us:\n\n🅾 INSTAGRAM: www.instagram.com/FPLBlackBox\n\n💻 DISCORD:   / discord  \n\n🐦X: https://www.x.com/fplblackbox\n-----------------------------------------------\n#FPLBlackBox #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #premierleague #GW1 Fantasy Football Scout, Fantasy Football Tips, Fantasy Football Gameweek 1 GW 1\n-----------------------------------------------\nContact us: \n\n📧 Az@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Andy@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Luke@fplblackbox.com","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":433,"length":30,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CNcBEM2rARgBIhMI0eHr6_OrlgMVnUnyAB2HagaQSN_V-96do6Sc1AHKAQRcAMzJ","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUTJVYVg3V0Z1S2l1a1RHOC1xYU12RnxBR3JiS2FuWmUtVFBKN0pzWWJWX2VDNG9keUV2cG9zV0pHY1c1MXFLZ2N1NE5pdEpGelBnQjgyVTgxTGZ1SlVpOVJ1NFY0cWxkT2c0VFFBb0c0UERfZWw0YWRvaXdkRnRHSlg5\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=1DiRGdve6t8","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUTJVYVg3V0Z1S2l1a1RHOC1xYU12RnxBR3JiS2FuWmUtVFBKN0pzWWJWX2VDNG9keUV2cG9zV0pHY1c1MXFLZ2N1NE5pdEpGelBnQjgyVTgxTGZ1SlVpOVJ1NFY0cWxkT2c0VFFBb0c0UERfZWw0YWRvaXdkRnRHSlg5\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=1DiRGdve6t8","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":718,"length":22,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CNcBEM2rARgBIhMI0eHr6_OrlgMVnUnyAB2HagaQSN_V-96do6Sc1AHKAQ